# v1.0.4

## Required Environment

- Game patch: FFXIV 7.56, hotfix 2
- Dalamud: v15.0.3.5 (API 15)

## Changelog

### New Features

- **Diadem orders.** Orders can now include Diadem materials, Skybuilders' approved materials and Grade 4 Skybuilders' crafts. Drakos gathers in the Diadem as Miner or Botanist and has Flotpassant inspect the materials in the Firmament. (`6caed6bc4`, `04e4ac731`)
- **Gemstone Trader materials.** Turn on the new setting Farm FATEs for bicolor gemstones, and Drakos farms Shaaloani FATEs on your combat job for bicolor gemstones and buys order materials from the Gemstone Trader. The setting is off by default. (`31e3065f9`, `c4c83de4b`)
- **Inventory tab in the desktop app.** Each character's tab shows the same bags, saddlebag and retainers as the in-game Stash panel, how full each one is and when it was last seen. (`b6ff55101`)
- **Saved runs in the desktop app.** The Orders tab lists your saved runs, and you can resume or delete each one. (`7919f2bba`)

### Improvements

- **Storage is now opt-in.** Drakos no longer puts items into or takes materials out of the saddlebag, retainers or the company chest unless you turn that on. This update turns Saddlebag storage, Retainer storage, Company chest storage and both Use stored materials options off once, so turn on again the ones you want. (`c864545ba`)
- Drakos shows names instead of ID numbers for items, leves, quests, retainers and zones. You now pick a leve in the Orders panel and your home crafting zone by name. (`431caf2a0`, `9f8047b00`)
- Quick Synthesis counts each item as it is made, Stop and Gently Stop quit the batch cleanly, and a resumed order crafts only what is left. (`46560ea99`, `49d14f467`)
- Getting off a flying mount is much faster. (`2d28a1b90`)
- Drakos buys everything one vendor sells for your order in a single visit. (`8bf3006b7`)
- Drakos dodges enemy area attacks better, including cone attacks. (`952d61f1b`, `470efb9c0`)
- Drakos picks the mender, appraiser, scrip exchange, summoning bell or company chest that costs the least to teleport to. (`a44d1a485`)
- Timed aethersand gathering plans only the node visits that fit the window and spends GP better. (`dc9948f5f`)
- Drakos skips a scrip purchase whose exchange it cannot reach, and the order goes on. (`739fecd7d`)
- Several game menus Drakos uses now read their option text from the game, a step toward clients in other languages. (`4dd1528f8`)

### Fixes

- Grouped orders keep the materials later groups need instead of stashing them and making them again. (`234fcbd05`)
- With both repair options off, Drakos stops crafting when gear breaks, and the order waits until you repair and press Resume. (`49d14f467`)
- Market board buying ends an item cleanly when nobody lists it or its last listing sells out. (`bfec857f3`, `ae596e20c`)
- The market board no longer shows the previous item's name over the next item's listings. (`ba7fddc8a`)
- A market run with nothing to buy now says so on the Market panel, and purchases count for the world they were made on. (`f2d9d6714`)
- World visits no longer misfire and retry while the world list is still loading. (`4911ca265`)
- A cordial used right after a gathering node runs out no longer fails. (`70ab9aacd`)
- Collectable gathering no longer pauses before Collect. (`85324838a`)
- Taking gear from a retainer works when the game puts new gear in the Armoury Chest. (`1d2f99899`)
- Scrip exchange purchases no longer stall when the exchange window opens slowly or right after a zone change. (`7ba3f0751`, `8c34f567c`)
- Drakos can gather, mount and dismount while you have a field gathering leve active. (`aa19325cf`)
- Starting a run closes a turn-in or inspection window that an earlier stop left open, instead of failing at once. (`813bebf62`)
- The alert sign over your character no longer shakes, and it stays in place after you hide and show the game UI. (`62098202a`, `e90bd6d9d`)
- The desktop app now handles an order check that finds nothing and an item with no recipe. (`2809b5a54`)

### Infrastructure

- The license screen keeps showing why a sign-in failed and what to do, instead of switching to Lost contact. (`f881d9fab`, `7334bc869`)
- Drakos is less likely to lose its license seat when a reconnect drops halfway. (`f0cd38f7a`)

### In progress

- Cosmic Exploration runs, Ishgard Restoration runs, quest automation, field gathering leves, a leveling mode and listing new items from the saddlebag are still being built. The Selling panel already shows the saddlebag listing option, but it does nothing yet. (`8ff94ec0a`, `036f7eab3`)
